# Angkutin — Order Flow: Implementation Plan (Revised)

## Flow Overview

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["1. AI Scanner\n(Simulasi)"] --> B["2. Order Form"]
    B --> C["3. Cari Kurir\n(PostGIS)"]
    C --> D["4. Pickup & Cancel"]
    D --> E["5. Timbang\n(Simulasi)"]
    E --> F["6. Payment\n(Xendit)"]
    F --> G["7. Summary\n& Deliver"]
```

