## Keputusan Teknis (Confirmed)

| Keputusan | Jawaban |
|-----------|---------|
| Maps Provider | **Mapbox** |
| WebSocket | **Socket.IO** |
| Payment Gateway | **Xendit** (QRIS) |
| Job Scheduler | **node-cron** |
| AI Scanner | **Simulasi** (hardcode dari BE, FE terima data) |
| IoT Timbangan | **Simulasi** (hardcode dari BE, FE animasi angka) |
| Courier Matching | **PostGIS nearest-first** + `order_offers` queue |
| OrderStatus enum | Ikut BE, **tanpa** `REASSIGNING` |
| CourierProfile | FE tetap pakai `vehiclePlate`, **tanpa** `rating`. BE menyesuaikan |

