### Cancellation Rules (Confirmed)
| Status | User Cancel? | Courier Cancel? |
|--------|:---:|:---:|
| CREATED | ✅ | — |
| MATCHED | ✅ | ✅ |
| ON_GOING | ✅ | ✅ |
| ARRIVED | ❌ | ✅ |
| WEIGHING | ❌ | ✅ |
| WAITING_PAYMENT | ❌ | ❌ |
| PICKED_UP+ | ❌ | ❌ |

> User bisa cancel sampai **ON_GOING**. Kurir bisa cancel sampai **WEIGHING** (sebelum form timbangan di-save).

