## Courier Matching Flow (PostGIS)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (PWA)
    participant BE as NestJS Backend
    participant DB as Supabase (PostGIS)
    participant SR as Supabase Realtime
    participant C as Courier (PWA)

    Note over DB: Prerequisite: postgis extension enabled,<br/>couriers.location = geography(Point,4326),<br/>GiST index on location

    C->>BE: Update location (setiap 10m movement)
    BE->>DB: UPDATE couriers SET location

    U->>BE: POST /orders (titik jemput + vehicle)
    BE->>DB: INSERT orders (status=CREATED)
    BE->>DB: PostGIS query: ST_DWithin 5km,<br/>status=AVAILABLE, vehicle match,<br/>ORDER BY distance, LIMIT 10
    DB-->>BE: 10 kandidat kurir terdekat
    BE->>DB: INSERT order_offers (PENDING, expires_at=+30s)
    SR-->>C: Realtime subscription trigger
    C->>C: Modal "Ada Orderan Baru" muncul

    alt Kurir Terima
        C->>BE: POST /orders/:id/accept
        BE->>DB: Transaction: cek status masih CREATED?
        BE->>DB: UPDATE order → MATCHED, courier → BUSY
        BE->>DB: DELETE sisa order_offers
        BE-->>U: Socket.IO: order:matched
        BE-->>C: Socket.IO: order:confirmed
    else Kurir Tolak / Timeout 30s
        BE->>DB: Mark offer EXPIRED
        BE->>BE: Coba kandidat berikutnya
    end
```

### BE Database Changes Needed
```sql
-- Enable PostGIS
CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS postgis;

-- Add location column to couriers
ALTER TABLE couriers ADD COLUMN location geography(Point, 4326);

-- Create spatial index
CREATE INDEX idx_couriers_location ON couriers USING GIST(location);

-- New table: order_offers
CREATE TABLE order_offers (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  order_id UUID REFERENCES orders(id),
  courier_id UUID REFERENCES couriers(id),
  status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'PENDING', -- PENDING, ACCEPTED, REJECTED, EXPIRED
  expires_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,
  created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);
```

