### Phase 4: Weighing (Simulasi) & Payment (Xendit)

#### Weighing Simulation Flow
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Courier (PWA)
    participant BE as Backend
    participant U as User (PWA)

    C->>BE: POST /orders/:id/start-weighing
    BE->>BE: Generate hardcoded weight data
    BE-->>C: Socket.IO: weighing:data {mutuKg, residuKg}
    BE-->>U: Socket.IO: weighing:data {mutuKg, residuKg}
    Note over C,U: FE animasi angka bergerak naik

    C->>C: Pilih jenis sampah mutu (dropdown)
    C->>C: Opsional: foto bukti residu
    C->>BE: POST /orders/:id/triage (submit form)
    BE->>BE: Hitung net balance (mutu - residu)

    alt Residu > Mutu (user bayar)
        BE-->>U: Socket.IO: payment:required {amount}
        U->>U: Pilih: Wallet atau QRIS
    else Mutu >= Residu (user untung)
        BE->>DB: Credit ke wallet user
        BE-->>C: Socket.IO: weighing:complete
    end
```

