## Backend API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Deskripsi |
|--------|----------|-----------|
| `POST` | `/api/orders` | Create order |
| `GET` | `/api/orders/:id` | Get order detail |
| `GET` | `/api/orders/mine` | Get my orders |
| `PATCH` | `/api/orders/:id/cancel` | Cancel order (cek rules) |
| `POST` | `/api/ai/scan` | Simulasi AI scanner (hardcode) |
| `PATCH` | `/api/courier/status` | Toggle online/offline |
| `POST` | `/api/courier/location` | Update GPS → PostGIS |
| `POST` | `/api/orders/:id/accept` | Kurir accept (race condition safe) |
| `POST` | `/api/orders/:id/reject` | Kurir reject |
| `POST` | `/api/orders/:id/arrive` | Kurir sampai lokasi |
| `POST` | `/api/orders/:id/start-weighing` | Trigger simulasi timbangan |
| `POST` | `/api/orders/:id/triage` | Submit form timbangan |
| `POST` | `/api/orders/:id/depart` | Kurir berangkat (scheduled) |
| `POST` | `/api/orders/:id/deliver` | Mulai delivery ke gudang |
| `POST` | `/api/orders/:id/complete` | Selesai |
| `POST` | `/api/payments/wallet` | Bayar via wallet |
| `POST` | `/api/payments/qris` | Generate QRIS (Xendit) |
| `GET` | `/api/payments/:id/status` | Cek status pembayaran |
| `GET` | `/api/addresses` | List alamat user |
| `POST` | `/api/addresses` | Tambah alamat |
| `PUT` | `/api/addresses/:id` | Update alamat |

### Socket.IO Namespaces
| Namespace | Events | Deskripsi |
|-----------|--------|-----------|
| `/orders` | `order:*` | Order lifecycle events |
| `/tracking` | `tracking:update` | Courier GPS realtime |
| `/weighing` | `weighing:data`, `weighing:complete` | Simulasi timbangan |
| `/payments` | `payment:required`, `payment:status` | Payment status |

